      "cwe_id": "CWE-59",
      "cwe_name": "Improper Link Resolution Before File Access ('Link Following')",
      "fit_reason": "FileCheckerThread monitors module file paths from sys.modules. If an attacker can replace a module file with a symlink, they could cause the reloader to follow symlinks to unintended files, potentially triggering reloads based on changes to arbitrary files."
    },
    {
      "cwe_id": "CWE-22",
      "cwe_name": "Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal')",
      "fit_reason": "While paths come from sys.modules, if an attacker can control which modules are loaded, they could potentially cause monitoring of files outside intended directories through path manipulation."
    },
    {
      "cwe_id": "CWE-20",
      "cwe_name": "Improper Input Validation",
      "fit_reason": "The file monitoring assumes sys.modules contains only trusted module paths, but lacks validation that these paths haven't been tampered with or that they point to expected locations."
